{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14689","headline":"抚州处士胡泛见送北回两馆至南昌县界查溪兰若别 · 戴叔伦","name":"抚州处士胡泛见送北回两馆至南昌县界查溪兰若别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移罇铺山曲，祖帐查溪阴。\n铺山即远道，查溪非故林。\n凄然诵新诗，落泪沾素襟。\n郡政我何有，别情君独深。\n禅庭古树秋，宿雨清沈沈。\n挥袂千里远，悲伤去住心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}